# MOVED — Platform rules now live in .platform-rules/ (canonical source).
#
# Cursor loads them natively from .cursor/rules/:
#   000-core.mdc      always-on core (routing, ports, security, sensitive files)
#   <topic>.mdc       auto-attached by file globs or picked by description
#
# This file remains only so very old Cursor versions see a pointer.
# Do not add rules here — edit .platform-rules/ and run:
#   node scripts/build-rule-adapters.js
